OL,3,GNEWSAFive more men charged over Glasgow
OL,4,AGreen protests disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive more people have been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with disorder on Glasgow
OL,8,FGreen in July involving
OL,9,Fanti-immigration and anti-racism
OL,10,Fcampaigners.
OL,12,FThe men, aged 41, 39, 27, 23 and 22,
OL,13,Fwere charged in connection with a range
OL,14,Fof offences including assault and
OL,15,Fpossession of offensive weapons.
OL,17,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said
OL,18,Fthey are expected to appear at Glasgow
OL,19,FSheriff Court at a later date.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
